<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIA LEAD FRANCE 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIA LEAD FRANCE 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the first day of the Davis Cup world group first-round tie between France and Australia on Friday (Australian names first):</p>
<p>Patrick Rafter beat Cedric Pioline 3-6 6-7 (5-7) 6-4 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde beat Arnaud Boetsch 6-4 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Australia lead 2-0.</p>
</text>
